{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0",
  "coursePackId": "synchronized-motor-control",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "displayName": "Synchronized motor control",
  "description": "Explicitly enables best-effort parallel bounded movement for assigned Sphero BOLT and Ollie robots. G2 and Meta structured voice, Even R1 gestures, and a discrete MindWave blink can use the same output group. An optional Tello fleet remains a separately armed takeoff/landing target; raw biosignals and vendor motor packets never enter this recipe.",
